      "title": "wiretap: Plug leaks on open failure",
      "message": "wiretap: Plug leaks on open failure\n\nFree various parts of the dump structure that are wiretap's\nresponsibility when open fails after they're created.\n\nFree the parameters that are the caller's responsibility in file.c\non a cf_save_records codepath where it isn't currently. It doesn't\nhappen at the fail label before exit because the parameters aren't\ncreated in the case of a quick binary copy or move.\n",
